{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（21日）凌晨4時許，一輛密斗貨車沿太子道東往觀塘方向，駛至新蒲崗采頤花園對開，失控撞向觀塘繞道支路的分岔路石壆，貨車撼向風琴式防撞欄後向左翻側，司機一度被困駕駛室，其後自行爬出，他頭、手腳受傷，清醒送往伊利沙伯醫院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:20:06.032883+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T21:38:05.802144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:17:37.673602+00:00","content_hash":"bff1a2874b3e3cb5b8894f169238c3162d4f757d5523c74765d2618613baea89","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}